@echo off
rem asight collector: launch shim for OpenCode on Windows (RFC 4.8 s6.3), written by the user-path opt-in item of
rem `asight on opencode --opt-in opencode.cli`. Trust is OpenCode's own in-process plugin, so only the proxy is set
rem here; an HTTPS_PROXY the shell already set is your choice for that run and is not overridden (that run is not
rem captured). `asight off opencode` removes it.
if not defined HTTPS_PROXY set "HTTPS_PROXY=__ASIGHT_PROXY__"
"__ASIGHT_REAL_BINARY__" %*
